  <!--
    Comparisons. Nine, not sixty-six.

    Twelve cities make sixty-six possible pairs, and that ratio is the point:
    pairs grow as the square of the cities, so "list them all" gets worse every
    time a city is added. Most of the sixty-six are comparisons nobody has ever
    wanted to read. These nine are ones people genuinely search for. The other
    fifty-seven still render and are still indexable if a crawler finds them;
    they are simply not advertised.

    Each is listed in one ordering only. Both orderings of a pair render, and
    both declare this same canonical, so the two can never compete.
  -->
